1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,333
Sunset. Sam stands waist deep with a
spear. Thirty yards behind him, a gray
fin turns.

2
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:08,133
Sam. Walk. Don't splash. Just walk.

3
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:13,033
Rule thirteen. Stay out of the water
at dawn and dusk. That's when they
hunt.
